# Unified --at <target> funnel rules
# Scopes the per-subcommand plan-path resolvers that must route through the
# ctx-aware front doors (resolvePlanPathCtx / resolvePlanPathWithActiveJobCtx)
# so the persistent --at target is honored, plus the scenario that pins the
# behavior. Changes here should trigger the at-target E2E scenario.

